Ada: Welcome to the Militia Trials. Today we find out who can still swing after a long winter.
- What's for sale?
	Ada: Ammunition, bandages, sandbags. Everything a militia runs out of.
	[signal arg="shop:festival"]
- How does the gauntlet work?
	Ada: Eight padded dummies past the fountain. Hit one and the clock starts. Two good strikes each puts them down.
	Ada: All eight in forty seconds. Under twenty-five and you take first prize.
- Is the militia recruiting?
	Ada: Always. Drill is every afternoon by the guild. Cole will tell you it's voluntary. Cole will be watching.
- Maybe later.
	Ada: Stay sharp out there.
